#46250
"Narrow Path Through the Forest"
"A narrow path winds between the tall and wide trees of the forest, carefully

cleared of brush and vines.  Leafy boughs far above shade the path, and a

single shallow rut runs along the center.  The path leads out of the forest

into open farmland to the west, turning into a wider road, and continues south

into the forest.

"
