#46252
"Small Farm Road"
"The dirt road runs between fences on either side, from a forest far east from

here to a large house visible far in the opposite direction.  A metal gate

hangs heavily from the southern fence, leading into an orchard on the other

side.  There is a simple latch that easily opens from either side.  Past the

wooden gated fence to the north is a thick field of golden wheat that sways

with the wind.

