shading the road a slight amount.  Through the northern fence poke golden

stalks and leaves of wheat plants that fill the field beyond it.  This simple

road continues west up to the steps of a large farmhouse and forks into a path

running both north and south, while to the east it continues between the two

fences for quite some distance.

