"The Orchard"
"Tall and skinny apple trees grow evenly spaced in perfectly straight rows,

probably all planted at the same time considering their similar sizes.  Apples

of varying sizes and maturity hang from the leafy green branches in plenty. 

An old metal gate confines the orchard, between wooden lengths that make up

the rest of the fence.

