#46259
"Entrance to a Large Farmhouse"
"This small entryway is decorated with a warm and welcoming decor, with knick-

knacks and small pictures displayed tastefully on a shelf on the south wall. 

The walls are whitewashed and painted white with pale green trim, making the

room seem open and larger than it's actual size.  Through a doorway to the

west is the dining room, which looks very cramped with the large table filling

most of the room.  To the north is the base of a set of stairs leading up to

the second floor.

"
