#46263
"The Orchard"
"A young apple tree grows here, healthy and still growing taller every season. 

Among its leafy branches are many green apples, small and large, some of which

are ripe for the picking now.  On the other side of the fence to the south you

can see a thriving cornfield, crows flying around it.

