feminine room.  Windows in both the outer walls of the house, north and west,

provide plenty of strong light to work by.  A finely-woven, half-finished

length of cloth is strung across the loom presently and several other projects

in varying degrees of completeness adorn every table and shelf.  A large

dying tub sits by the western window.

